{"asset_key":"ep5/herohub_story_15411230","episode":"ep5","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"15411230","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1541123001:1":{"text":"... Stop staring at my tails.","source_cn":"……不要一直盯着我的尾巴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x291C2631309BF9EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1541123002:0":{"text":"If you're curious about anything, just ask.","source_cn":"有什么想问的，可以直接问。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E2DE1D7D945C600","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1541123002":{"text":"If you're curious about anything, just ask.","source_cn":"有什么想问的，可以直接问。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E2DE1D7D945C600","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1541123004:1":{"text":"Why not? I was born this way.","source_cn":"何必惊讶？这不过是伴随我降生的一个特点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1539074440038C0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1541123005:0":{"text":"Some folks have six fingers. Some have folded ears. Same thing.","source_cn":"就像有人天生六指，有人天生折耳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE7B53532B71CDDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1541123006:1":{"text":"According to Modra, the only Wildborn besides you with two tails was a warrior from many years ago.","source_cn":"蒙多说，除了你之外，雅库伯尔只有几十年前的一位战士长有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79874E3E6E1FDACF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1541123007:1":{"text":"The old scrolls say he had two souls. Spoke in two voices. Acted like two different people.","source_cn":"根据流传下来的卷轴记载，他体内似乎住了两个灵魂，说话语...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88E892A03E06CCF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1541123008:1":{"text":"Yeah. I've heard the story many times.","source_cn":"我知道。这件事我也听说过无数次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBD91607FE7D22E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1541123009:1":{"text":"They say a priestess made a prophecy about him. Said the Hunting Goddess would bless him. Two souls meant double the strength.","source_cn":"当时的巫祭做出了预言，预言他将得到狩猎神的眷顾。因为拥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC39F740BBF8BB3B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1541123010:1":{"text":"But he never did win in the Bloodhunt Festival. People were pretty disappointed.","source_cn":"但他最终没能赢得猎血节的荣耀，令所有人都失望了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FBC6F317736CC5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1541123011:1":{"text":"But you won the hunt. Maybe the prophecy was meant for you.","source_cn":"可你是猎血节的赢家。也许巫祭的预言在你身上应验了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE591DFC9C0B9FD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1541123012:0":{"text":"... Maybe.","source_cn":"……也许吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02664523440D627A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1541123013:1":{"text":"But I don't have two souls. Not now, anyway.","source_cn":"但我没有两个灵魂。至少，此时此刻没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15B6F0681309FBBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1541123013":{"text":"But I don't have two souls. Not now, anyway.","source_cn":"但我没有两个灵魂。至少，此时此刻没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15B6F0681309FBBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1541123014:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1541123016:0":{"text":"Whether I have a second soul or not, it's my business. No need to worry yourself over it.","source_cn":"无论有没有第二个灵魂，都是我自己的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE5AB02AACA6AB89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"Not now? Then you once did?","source_cn":"现在没有，说明以前有？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD76AE1CF93B6AB30","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Not now? Then you once did?","female":"Not now? Then you once did?","variant_male_record_index":"79249","variant_female_record_index":"79250","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1541123015:1":{"text":"... Who knows.","source_cn":"……谁知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAB1916C8CBC7FED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:1:2":{"text":"You think you'll do someday?","source_cn":"难道你觉得以后会有？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCFF4D435418B6BA0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You think you'll do someday?","female":"You think you'll do someday?","variant_male_record_index":"79251","variant_female_record_index":"79252","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"Why do you have two tails?","source_cn":"你为什么有两条尾巴？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x665BCAA1B79FB889","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Why do you have two tails?","female":"Why do you have two tails?","variant_male_record_index":"79245","variant_female_record_index":"79246","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1541123003:1":{"text":"... Yeah. I've been told that enough times.","source_cn":"……这话我听过很多次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAB19E3B6D83CCF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"People with two tails are rare.","source_cn":"长着两条尾巴的人很少见","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8AA2A8DD666C908F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"People with two tails are rare.","female":"People with two tails are rare.","variant_male_record_index":"79247","variant_female_record_index":"79248","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:那非":{"text":"Nazrik","source":"那非","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"Gala","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":23,"localized_text_count":22,"speaker_count":2}}